# Build Your Own Login Form

You can create a simple HTML page at `src/main/resources/templates/login.html` (if using Thymeleaf) and set `.loginPage("/login")`.

You'll also need a controller to serve that page:

```java
@Controller
public class LoginController {
    @GetMapping("/login")
    public String login() {
        return "login";
    }
}
```

The form must POST to `/login` with parameters `username` and `password`.
